<title>USA: Cali Realty to buy two office complexes.</title>
<headline>Cali Realty to buy two office complexes.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said on Thursday it had agreed to buy two office complexes comprising 600,000 square feet for $78 million cash.</p>
<p>The properties are located in Bergen County, New Jersey, and suburban Philadelphia, the company said.</p>
<p>Both acquisitions are expected to close within 45 days, the company said.</p>
<p>The name of the selling party or parties was not available.</p>
</text>
